oogle.com/spreadsheets/d/1X6qQzoAPrSRNzl3cQcMWasoPv3eK56sIlAOTeay61No/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Gather an army of Rage! Random Garou Generator.</a><br /> Shapeshifting Historian<br /> Writer - Werewolf: the Apocalypse, Werewolf: the Forsaken, Exalted 3e, TC: \u00c6on","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/167-nikink","name":"nikink","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-11T03:00:11-07:00","id":1463404,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460695-the-apocalyptic-record-ks-has-begun?p=1463397#post1463397\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, since this is an old bugbear; Alby's pack needs a name and a totem. Please?</div> </div> </div> </div>I like that they don't have a name or a totem. I feel, that it isn't obligatory.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-11T03:28:23-07:00","id":1463407,"title":"","content":"I gave one pack a name and didn't provide a Totem. I left another pack unnamed and Totemless, although certain longtime or well-read readers could probably make a decent guess as to who and what those nameless things could be. And two packs unnamed and un-Totem-ed, since it wasn't particularly relevant and the word count only goes so far.<br /> <br /> I mean, that word count is the real reason for leaving details undefined, although there's a case to be made for leaving stuff open for players to value-add.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/ofii86boiyk38ng/DtDRandomForms.zip\" target=\"_blank\">Open the gates of Hell: Random Demon Generator.</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1X6qQzoAPrSRNzl3cQcMWasoPv3eK56sIlAOTeay61No/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Gather an army of Rage! Random Garou Generator.</a><br /> Shapeshifting Historian<br /> Writer - Werewolf: the Apocalypse, Werewolf: the Forsaken, Exalted 3e, TC: \u00c6on","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/167-nikink","name":"nikink","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-11T03:47:09-07:00","id":1463412,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460695-the-apocalyptic-record-ks-has-begun?p=1463397#post1463397\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, since this is an old bugbear; Alby's pack needs a name and a totem. Please?</div> </div> </div> </div>I may be wrong, because I read the The Silver Crown sooooo many years ago, but I believe Morningkill's pack was simply called The King's Pack. I really like this idea that by tradition whenever a Silver Fang ascends to the throne his pack gets renamed after him...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/mxyvsy9\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img19/986/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/k5qe4j4\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img546/6111/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nd6kms2\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2766-wolfen","name":"Wolfen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-11T05:05:32-07:00","id":1463414,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wolfen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460695-the-apocalyptic-record-ks-has-begun?p=1463412#post1463412\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I may be wrong, because I read the The Silver Crown sooooo many years ago, but I believe Morningkill's pack was simply called The King's Pack. I really like this idea that by tradition whenever a Silver Fang ascends to the throne his pack gets renamed after him...</div> </div> </div> </div>Full text searched my way trough it, and Arkady's pack is called &quot;The King's Own&quot;, having been Morningkill's pack originally - before he moved from an more active part to full-time ruling - I guess.<br /> <br /> The King of House Winter Snow - well, an ancestor spirit presenting as him - also calls his pack the &quot;King's Own Pack&quot;.<br /> <br /> So, yes, it might be a tradition, and possibly, the Garou in Albrecht's sept would call it by that name out of tradition, but I think the pack wouldn't adopt the name. Mari wouldn't let the notion stand, that Albrecht owned the pack.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-11T09:06:36-07:00","id":1463428,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nikink</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460695-the-apocalyptic-record-ks-has-begun?p=1463407#post1463407\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I gave one pack a name and didn't provide a Totem. I left another pack unnamed and Totemless, although certain longtime or well-read readers could probably make a decent guess as to who and what those nameless things could be. And two packs unnamed and un-Totem-ed, since it wasn't particularly relevant and the word count only goes so far.<br /> <br /> I mean, that word count is the real reason for leaving details undefined, although there's a case to be made for leaving stuff open for players to value-add.</div> </div> </div> </div>It is mostly due to Alby and Mari being such important characters, that knowing what to call the pack and what totem they follow would be important info.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-11T10:36:26-07:00","id":1463437,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460695-the-apocalyptic-record-ks-has-begun?p=1463428#post1463428\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It is mostly due to Alby and Mari being such important characters, that knowing what to call the pack and what totem they follow would be important info.</div> </div> </div> </div>My two cents is that they follow Falcon, but probably have no name, so each calls them whatever they want. They're as much the King's Own as Mari's Gang.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-11T16:10:33-07:00","id":1463484,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460695-the-apocalyptic-record-ks-has-begun?p=1463428#post1463428\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It is mostly due to Alby and Mari being such important characters...</div> </div> </div> </div>You calling him Alby makes me giggle... that's why Konietzko is more respected, no one would dare call him Margry... kkkkk...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/mxyvsy9\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img19/986/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/k5qe4j4\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img546/6111/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nd6kms2\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2766-wolfen","name":"Wolfen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-11T16:19:34-07:00","id":1463485,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>heinrich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460695-the-apocalyptic-record-ks-has-begun?p=1463414#post1463414\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Full text searched my way trough it, and Arkady's pack is called &quot;The King's Own&quot;, having been Morningkill's pack originally - before he moved from an more active part to full-time ruling - I guess.<br /> <br /> The King of House Winter Snow - well, an ancestor spirit presenting as him - also calls his pack the &quot;King's Own Pack&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Now, it would be amazing if I could convince my memory to save information that is relevant to my adult life...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>heinrich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460695-the-apocalyptic-record-ks-has-begun?p=1463414#post1463414\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, yes, it might be a tradition, and possibly, the Garou in Albrecht's sept would call it by that name out of tradition, but I think the pack wouldn't adopt the name. Mari wouldn't let the notion stand, that Albrecht owned the pack.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep, she'd never agree to be treated as a mere retainer... man, I'll miss reading tales of their rivalry when W5 arrives, it'll be strange not to see their combat on the pages of the new book...<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/mxyvsy9\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img19/986/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/k5qe4j4\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img546/6111/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nd6kms2\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2766-wolfen","name":"Wolfen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-11T18:06:22-07:00","id":1463508,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wolfen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460695-the-apocalyptic-record-ks-has-begun?p=1463484#post1463484\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You calling him Alby makes me giggle... that's why Konietzko is more respected, no one would dare call him Margry... kkkkk...</div> </div> </div> </div>I assume nobody calls him Margry because the characters in the setting know that Margrave is a title, and the man's first name is Yuri.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-11T18:20:23-07:00","id":1463510,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460695-the-apocalyptic-record-ks-has-begun?p=1463508#post1463508\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate