onyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-12T02:48:32-07:00","id":1463564,"title":"","content":"Ragabash Tales - the next preview chapter - is up for backers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-12T13:10:59-07:00","id":1463607,"title":"","content":"<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Okay, the ragabash chapter has a LOT of good stuff. But as a Silver Fang player and one who REALLY disliked the damned 'let us mass produce crinos-born' thing in Changing Ways, I found the Blood Red Crest section amazing.<br /> <br /> My main problem with the Mass Produced Crinos-Born thing, is that it is far more costly to produce crinos-born than lupus pups. It also takes much longer.<br /> <br /> But what Blood Red Crest are doing makes sense, they are desperate, enough to use the only 100% garou producing method. They cannot breed wolves, because their garou birth rates would stay the same. It makes sense, even as desperate as it is.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-18T19:05:45-07:00","id":1464449,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460695-the-apocalyptic-record-ks-has-begun?p=1463552#post1463552\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe that's just because it isn't a common enough title in English, and doing this with titles isn't a thing in every language. We don't do this in Portuguese, at least here in Brazil, for example.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep, it's not that common to use title diminutives. But I wouldn't call him Konnie or Kony either... kkkkk...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460695-the-apocalyptic-record-ks-has-begun?p=1463552#post1463552\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But I already had a character call him Yurizinho (something like Yury, or Yuri-chan). Repeatedly.</div> </div> </div> </div>Lucky you, the ST really likes your character... lol<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/mxyvsy9\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img19/986/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/k5qe4j4\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img546/6111/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nd6kms2\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2766-wolfen","name":"Wolfen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core